  ] ) ; # 
  fhir:description [ fhir:v "A demonstration IG that declares, as TestPlan resources and Gherkin feature files, the conformance tests for the three actors of the HL7 International Patient Summary (IPS) 2.0.1: Creator, Consumer and Server. The tests are derived mechanically from the obligations the IPS profiles state, and every obligation is traceable to a test case that names its element."] ; # 
